{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17215060","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17215060","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1721506001:1":{"text":"……エイドリアン様、指揮官。","source_cn":"……司令，殿下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC15AFA8BBEB06CD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721506002:1":{"text":"グウィネス隊長、なぜここにいるのか説明してもらおうか！","source_cn":"格温妮丝队长！解释你的行为！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3213358F94848CC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721506003:1":{"text":"無断で持ち場を離れたうえ、殿下への軍事報告まで盗み聞きしていたのか？","source_cn":"未经许可擅离职守，还躲在暗处窃听王储的高级军事汇报？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6B5BADB3EB32BC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721506004:2":{"text":"申し訳ありません、指揮官！指揮官が王宮に戻られたと聞き、いても立ってもいられず……すべて私の落ち度です！","source_cn":"万分抱歉，司令！属下听闻王宫内有您出现的消息，一时情急...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3091A9B8D765DDEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721506005:1":{"text":"そのくらいにしてやれ、ヘンドリック卿。ここは軍営じゃないんだ。","source_cn":"好了，亨德里克卿，不必如此苛责。这里可不是军营。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE420A61FE47BB6C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","do